WP:DescVector
"Precision battle tank. Strong armor and long reach; vulnerable to rockets. Requires a Vehicle Plant."
END

WP:DescFabricator
"Construction vehicle. Builds and repairs Meridian structures."
END

WP:DescPowerArray
"Generates 12 power. A power shortage slows Combine production; keep a reserve."
END

WP:DescVehiclePlant
"Produces Meridian armor: the Vector, Outrider, and Zenith."
END

WP:DescOutrider
"Fast recon car. Spots ambushes and suppresses infantry; avoid tanks."
END

WP:DescZenith
"Long-range siege gun. Devastating at a distance, helpless up close."
END

WP:DescVulture
"Light raiding truck. Cheap and quick, with a gun for supply-line attacks. Fragile in a stand-up fight."
END

WP:DescMongrel
"Fast, affordable battle tank. Outnumbers expensive armor; keep rifles nearby. Requires a Chop Shop."
END

WP:DescRigger
"Salvage rig. Builds and repairs Jackal structures."
END

WP:DescBulwark
"Automated defense turret. Holds the line while your armor is away. Requires power to fire."
END

WP:DescChopShop
"Produces Jackal vehicles: the Mongrel and the Vulture."
END

WP:DescWatchpost
"Ground-defense tower. Holds off hostile ground units. Use Flakhuts against aircraft."
END

WP:DescCancelConstruction
"Stop construction and refund the full cost."
END

